    "title": "PadSplit: Rooms for rent",
    "description": "Download the PadSplit App for an enhanced co-living experience. Through the PadSplit app, members can:\r\n\r\nComplete a membership application\r\n- Book the perfect room to suit your budget and needs\r\n- Move-in within 48 hrs\r\n- Pay your dues\r\n- Chat with your housemates and host\r\n- Stay in the loop regarding all happenings within your home!\r\n\r\nIf you are a host, you can:\r\n- Use the anytime messenger to communicate anytime with Members in your home\r\n- Set messaging hours and preferences\r\n- View member profiles\r\n- Set automated move-in messages",
